      "sequence_position": 6,
      "problem": "What is the quotient of $-2{x}^{4}+11{x}^{3}-17{x}^{2}+3x+3$ divided by $-{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-2x+1?$\n\nThe quotient is\n{{field-1}}.",
